# Read top to bottom. A later line can undo an earlier one.
#
#   no slash      matches that name in any directory
#   a slash       rooted here, at the repo root
#   trailing /    directories only
#   leading !     keep a path an earlier rule ignored
#
# A ! cannot bring a file back once a parent directory is ignored.
# data/* ignores the children and leaves data/ itself matchable,
# so a later !data/.gitkeep would work. data/ would make that impossible.

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
# .env* matches .env, .env.local, and .env.example.
# The example has names only, so it stays in git. The ! must come after.
.env*
!.env.example

# --- Dependencies and build output -----------------------------------------
# No slash, so api/node_modules and ingest/dist match too.
node_modules/
dist/
build/

# --- Local data and logs ---------------------------------------------------
# A slash in the middle roots these at the top of the repo.
# ingest/data/ is not covered.
# * does not match a slash. data/raw is ignored as a directory,
# so everything under data/raw/ goes with it.
data/*
logs/*
